  "description": "CR 603.2 / 205.4a / 602.5d / 701.27a / 115.1 / 611.2a / 608.2c: Venat draws for your first legendary spell each turn, not a nonlegendary spell nor an opponent's legendary spell, and its sorcery-speed {7}, {T} exiles a nonland permanent and transforms it; Hydaelyn's beginning-of-combat trigger counters another creature you control, gives it indestructible until your next turn, and draws only when it is legendary",
  "note": "Lions (nonlegendary) is cast first so a missing legendary filter draws there; Caelorna is the second legendary spell, so a missing once-each-turn limit draws there; bob's Isamaru on his turn shows the you-cast scope. The turn-3 target is the nonlegendary Lions, so no card is drawn; the turn-5 target is Isamaru, so one is. The Lions lose indestructible by alice's turn 5. bob's Isamaru is the refused upkeep activation's target too, with all seven lands untapped.",
